    <node id="5075eaf6-e1dc-4aed-884a-f71d1c065365">
      <data key="d0">{"name":"Term Life Insurance Details","text":"═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n                    LIFE INSURANCE POLICY\n                    SecureLife Insurance Company\n═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n\nPOLICY NUMBER: SL-2024-TRM-00123\nISSUE DATE: January 15, 2024\nPOLICY TYPE: 20-Year Level Term Life Insurance\n\n───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\nSECTION 1: POLICY OWNER AND INSURED\n───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n\nPolicy Owner: John Michael Anderson\nInsured Person: John Michael Anderson\nDate of Birth: March 22, 1985\nAge at Issue: 38 years\n\n───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\nSECTION 2: COVERAGE DETAILS\n───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n\nDeath Benefit Amount: $500,000\nPolicy Term: 20 years (expires January 15, 2044)\nPremium Amount: $45.00 per month\nPremium Payment Mode: Monthly automatic deduction\n\n───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\nSECTION 3: BENEFICIARY DESIGNATION\n───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n\nPrimary Beneficiary: Sarah Elizabeth Anderson (Spouse) - 100%\nContingent Beneficiary: Emma Grace Anderson (Daughter) - 50%\n                        Lucas James Anderson (Son) - 50%\n\n───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\nSECTION 4: DEFINITIONS\n───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n\n4.1 \"Death Benefit\" means the amount payable to the beneficiary \n    upon the death of the insured during the policy term.\n\n4.2 \"Premium Due Date\" means the 15th day of each month.\n\n4.3 \"Grace Period\" means the 31-day period following the premium \n    due date during which coverage continues without lapse.\n\n4.4 \"Policy Anniversary\" means the same day and month as the \n    issue date in each subsequent year.\n\n────────────────────────────────────────────────","summary":"This 20-year level term life insurance policy issued by SecureLife Insurance Company provides a $500,000 death benefit to the primary beneficiary, Sarah Elizabeth Anderson, upon the death of the insured, John Michael Anderson, within the 20-year term. Premiums of $45 monthly are automatically deducted on the 15th of each month, with a 31-day grace period after the due date. Contingent beneficiaries are his children, Emma and Lucas, who share equal portions if the primary beneficiary predeceases him.","topics":["Life Insurance","Beneficiary Designation","Term Policy","Premium Payments"],"facts":[{"name":"Policy Number Identification","sentence":"The policy number is SL-2024-TRM-00123.","macro_topics":[],"chunk_topics":["policy number","insurance identification","document reference"],"entities":[{"name":"John Michael Anderson","type":"PERSON","role":"Policy Owner and Insured","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"Sarah Elizabeth Anderson","type":"PERSON","role":"Primary Beneficiary","relational_anchors":["Spouse"]},{"name":"Emma Grace Anderson","type":"PERSON","role":"Contingent Beneficiary","relational_anchors":["Daughter"]},{"name":"Lucas James Anderson","type":"PERSON","role":"Contingent Beneficiary","relational_anchors":["Son"]},{"name":"SecureLife Insurance Company","type":"ORGANIZATION","role":"Issuing Insurance Provider","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"Death Benefit","type":"CONCEPT","role":"Payable benefit upon death","relational_anchors":["$500,000"]},{"name":"Premium Due Date","type":"CONCEPT","role":"Monthly payment deadline","relational_anchors":["15th day of each month"]},{"name":"Grace Period","type":"CONCEPT","role":"Coverage continuation window","relational_anchors":["31-day period"]},{"name":"Policy Anniversary","type":"CONCEPT","role":"Annual renewal reference point","relational_anchors":["same day and month as the issue date"]},{"name":"January 15, 2024","type":"DATE","role":"Issue Date of Policy","relational_anchors":["SL-2024-TRM-00123"]},{"name":"March 22, 1985","type":"DATE","role":"Birthdate of Insured","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"January 15, 2044","type":"DATE","role":"Expiration Date of Policy Term","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"SL-2024-TRM-00123","type":"NUMBER","role":"Unique Policy Identifier","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"20 years","type":"NUMBER","role":"Duration of Policy Term","relational_anchors":["expires January 15, 2044"]},{"name":"$45.00","type":"NUMBER","role":"Monthly Premium Amount","relational_anchors":["per month"]}]},{"name":"Issue Date Specification","sentence":"The issue date of the policy is January 15, 2024.","macro_topics":[],"chunk_topics":["Issue Date","Policy Start","Temporal Reference"],"entities":[{"name":"John Michael Anderson","type":"PERSON","role":"Policy Owner and Insured","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"Sarah Elizabeth Anderson","type":"PERSON","role":"Primary Beneficiary","relational_anchors":["Spouse"]},{"name":"Emma Grace Anderson","type":"PERSON","role":"Contingent Beneficiary","relational_anchors":["Daughter"]},{"name":"Lucas James Anderson","type":"PERSON","role":"Contingent Beneficiary","relational_anchors":["Son"]},{"name":"SecureLife Insurance Company","type":"ORGANIZATION","role":"Issuing Insurance Provider","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"Death Benefit","type":"CONCEPT","role":"Payable benefit upon death","relational_anchors":["$500,000"]},{"name":"Premium Due Date","type":"CONCEPT","role":"Monthly payment deadline","relational_anchors":["15th day of each month"]},{"name":"Grace Period","type":"CONCEPT","role":"Coverage continuation window","relational_anchors":["31-day period"]},{"name":"Policy Anniversary","type":"CONCEPT","role":"Annual renewal reference point","relational_anchors":["same day and month as the issue date"]},{"name":"January 15, 2024","type":"DATE","role":"Issue Date of Policy","relational_anchors":["SL-2024-TRM-00123"]},{"name":"March 22, 1985","t