    <node id="6b85ea5f-b56f-400a-b095-6cd27fbec488">
      <data key="d0">{"name":"Life Policy Conversion &amp; Claim Guidelines","text":" based on:\n    (a) The insured's attained age at conversion\n    (b) The amount of coverage converted\n    (c) The class of permanent policy selected\n\n───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\nSECTION 9: CLAIMS PROCEDURE\n───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n\n9.1 To claim the death benefit, the beneficiary must submit:\n    (a) Completed claim form\n    (b) Certified copy of the death certificate\n    (c) Original policy document (if available)\n\n9.2 Claims should be sent to:\n    SecureLife Insurance Company\n    Claims Department\n    P.O. Box 5000, Hartford, CT 06102\n\n9.3 We will pay valid claims within 30 days of receiving all \n    required documentation.\n\n───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\nSECTION 10: GENERAL PROVISIONS\n───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n\n10.1 INCONTESTABILITY: We cannot contest this policy after it \n     has been in force during the insured's lifetime for two \n     years from the issue date.\n\n10.2 MISSTATEMENT OF AGE OR SEX: If the age or sex of the \n     insured has been misstated, we will adjust the death \n     benefit to what the premiums paid would have purchased \n     at the correct age and sex.\n\n10.3 ASSIGNMENT: You may assign this policy. We are not \n     responsible for the validity of any assignment. An \n     assignment is not binding on us until we receive written \n     notice at our home office.\n\n\n═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n\nAuthorized Signature: ___________________________\n                     Chief Underwriting Officer\n                     SecureLife Insurance Company\n\nDate Issued: January 15, 2024\n\n═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n","summary":"This document outlines critical aspects of an individual life insurance policy, focusing on conversion eligibility based on attained age, coverage amount, and chosen permanent policy class. It details the claims procedure requiring a completed form, certified death certificate, and original policy, with payment expected within 30 days of full documentation receipt. General provisions include a two-year incontestability period, adjustment of benefits for misstated age or sex, and requirements for valid policy assignments. The policy was issued by SecureLife Insurance Company on January 15, 2024.","topics":["Insurance Conversion","Claims Process","Policy Provisions"],"facts":[{"name":"Conversion Age Impact","sentence":"The insured's attained age at conversion affects the conversion outcome.","macro_topics":[],"chunk_topics":["conversion outcome","insured's attained age","policy conversion factors"],"entities":[{"name":"SECTION 9: CLAIMS PROCEDURE","type":"SECTION","role":"defines claim submission process","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"completed claim form","type":"DOCUMENT","role":"mandatory item for claiming benefits","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"certified copy of the death certificate","type":"DOCUMENT","role":"proof of insured’s passing","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"original policy document","type":"DOCUMENT","role":"validating proof of coverage","relational_anchors":["if available"]},{"name":"SecureLife Insurance Company","type":"ORGANIZATION","role":"claims processing authority","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"Claims Department","type":"DEPARTMENT","role":"receiving and handling claims","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"P.O. Box 5000, Hartford, CT 06102","type":"LOCATION","role":"claim mailing address","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"within 30 days","type":"TIME_PERIOD","role":"processing timeline for claims","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"INCONTESTABILITY","type":"PROVISION","role":"limits insurer challenge period","relational_anchors":["after it has been in force ... for two years"]},{"name":"MISSTATEMENT OF AGE OR SEX","type":"PROVISION","role":"adjusts death benefit based on error","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"ASSIGNMENT","type":"PROVISION","role":"permits transfer of policy rights","relational_anchors":["until we receive written notice at our home office"]},{"name":"Chief Underwriting Officer","type":"PERSON","role":"authorized signatory for issuance","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"January 15, 2024","type":"DATE","role":"issue date of policy","relational_anchors":[]}]},{"name":"Coverage Amount Impact","sentence":"The amount of coverage converted affects the conversion outcome.","macro_topics":[],"chunk_topics":["conversion outcome","coverage amount","policy conversion"],"entities":[{"name":"SECTION 9: CLAIMS PROCEDURE","type":"SECTION","role":"defines claim submission process","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"completed claim form","type":"DOCUMENT","role":"mandatory item for claiming benefits","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"certified copy of the death certificate","type":"DOCUMENT","role":"proof of insured’s passing","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"original policy document","type":"DOCUMENT","role":"validating proof of coverage","relational_anchors":["if available"]},{"name":"SecureLife Insurance Company","type":"ORGANIZATION","role":"claims processing authority","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"Claims Department","type":"DEPARTMENT","role":"receiving and handling claims","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"P.O. Box 5000, Hartford, CT 06102","type":"LOCATION","role":"claim mailing address","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"within 30 days","type":"TIME_PERIOD","role":"processing timeline for claims","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"INCONTESTABILITY","type":"PROVISION","role":"limits insurer challenge period","relational_anchors":["after it has been in force ... for two years"]},{"name":"MISSTATEMENT OF AGE OR SEX","type":"PROVISION","role":"adjusts death benefit based on error","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"ASSIGNMENT","type":"PROVISION","role":"permits transfer of policy rights","relational_anchors":["until we receive written notice at our home office"]},{"name":"Chief Underwriting Officer","type":"PERSON","role":"authorized signatory for issuance","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"January 15, 2024","type":"DATE","role":"issue date of policy","relational_anchors":[]}]},{"name":"Policy Class Impact on Conversion","sentence":"The class of permanent policy selected affects the conversion outcome.","macro_topics":[],"chunk_topics":["conversion outcome","permanent policy class","policy selection factor"],"entities":[{"name":"SECTION 9: CLAIMS PROCEDURE","type":"SECTION","role":"defines claim submission process","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"completed claim form","type":"DOCUMENT","role":"mandatory item for claiming benefits","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"certified copy of the death certificate","type":"DOCUMENT","role":"proof of insured’s passing","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"original policy document","type":"DOCUMENT","role":"validating proof of coverage","relational_anchors":["if available"]},{"name":"SecureLife Insurance Company","type":"ORGANIZATION","role":"claims processing authority","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"Claims Department","type":"DEPARTMENT","role":"receiving and handling claims","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"P.O. Box 5000, Hartford, CT 06102","type":"LOCATION","role":"claim mailing address","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"within 30 days","type":"TIME_PERIOD","role":"processing timeline for claims","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"INCONTESTABILITY","type":"PROVISION","role":"limits insurer challenge period","relational_anchors":["after it has been in force ... for two years"]},{"name":"MISSTATEMENT OF AGE OR SEX","type":"PROVISION","role":"adjusts death benefit based on error","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"ASSIGNMENT","type":"PROVISION","role":"permits transfer of policy rights","relational_anchors":["until we receive written notice at our home office"]},{"name":"Chief 