      <data key="d3">The policy's 20-year term begins on the issue date of January 15, 2024, meaning coverage ends on January 15, 2044. This temporal context anchors the duration of the policy.</data>
      <data key="d4">starts term</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="b178757c-5941-42c0-9651-c1536385e35b" target="6bf61b64-8ea1-4157-b63e-7ea1c96a8aa9">
      <data key="d3">The policy’s issue date marks when coverage began, setting the timeframe during which the $500,000 death benefit would apply if triggered by the insured’s passing.</data>
      <data key="d4">applies to</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.75</data>
    </edge>
