      <data key="d3">The policy's expiration date establishes the timeframe during which the death benefit is active. Since Sarah Elizabeth Anderson is named as the primary beneficiary, she remains eligible to receive 100% of the benefit if John Michael Anderson dies before the policy terminates.</data>
