      <data key="d3">The policy's end date on January 15, 2044, sets the timeframe during which the monthly automatic deductions apply. This deadline ensures that the payment schedule remains relevant only within the 20-year coverage window.</data>
      <data key="d4">precedes</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
