      <data key="d3">The policy's expiration date determines whether the death benefit can still be claimed; if the insured dies after January 15, 2044, no payout occurs. Thus, submitting a death certificate becomes irrelevant beyond the expiry window.</data>
      <data key="d4">depends on</data>
