    <edge source="92e1786a-d888-499c-81ce-89af6f2f700d" target="bd80be22-bae6-431a-81b1-2f430fdc473c">
      <data key="d3">Fact sentence 2 states the monthly premium amount, which applies to the policy identified in fact sentence 1. This establishes a connection where the premium is associated with the specific policy referenced by its number.</data>
      <data key="d4">related to</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.6</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="92e1786a-d888-499c-81ce-89af6f2f700d" target="b178757c-5941-42c0-9651-c1536385e35b">
      <data key="d3">The fixed monthly premium of $45.00 applies from the policy’s issue date onward, meaning payments begin shortly after January 15, 2024, based on the billing schedule.</data>
      <data key="d4">applies from date</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.75</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="92e1786a-d888-499c-81ce-89af6f2f700d" target="e2e0db09-1411-4193-961b-49f641340784">
      <data key="d3">A $45 monthly premium is characteristic of a 20-Year Level Term Life Insurance policy, reflecting its stable pricing model over time.</data>
      <data key="d4">example of</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.85</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="92e1786a-d888-499c-81ce-89af6f2f700d" target="c3e2289f-6e9b-4f8f-8308-ced029f5f506">
      <data key="d3">The requirement to pay a $45 monthly premium applies specifically because John Michael Anderson owns the policy and is responsible for its upkeep.</data>
      <data key="d4">required by</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="92e1786a-d888-499c-81ce-89af6f2f700d" target="7f8cb083-f7ed-4837-a460-150e15a7c2d1">
      <data key="d3">The $45 monthly premium is required to maintain the policy’s validity for John Michael Anderson, reflecting the cost of insuring his life over the 20-year term.</data>
      <data key="d4">applies to</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.65</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="92e1786a-d888-499c-81ce-89af6f2f700d" target="46205e89-c698-46b2-991f-35e0dd9be668">
      <data key="d3">The fixed monthly premium of $45 is derived from an actuarial evaluation that includes the insured’s age of 38 as one key factor influencing cost.</data>
      <data key="d4">determined by</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.75</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="92e1786a-d888-499c-81ce-89af6f2f700d" target="70feef39-e3b5-4a93-9e69-79a091efe2e9">
      <data key="d3">The consistent $45 monthly premium applies only while the policy remains active, up until its expiration on January 15, 2044.</data>
      <data key="d4">applies during</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.75</data>
    </edge>
