      <data key="d3">Monthly automatic deduction of premiums is consistent with typical implementation practices for a 20-Year Level Term Life Insurance policy, supporting its operational execution.</data>
      <data key="d4">corroborates</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
