      <data key="d3">Monthly automatic deductions continue until the policy terminates on January 15, 2044, meaning the payment frequency is sustained over the entire term up to expiry.</data>
      <data key="d4">continues until</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.75</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="c213cb6d-bc43-42c0-9cc8-b53860ab254b" target="101a86f6-cba5-43af-ae57-a5d5f17d8c1d">
      <data key="d3">Monthly automatic deductions ensure timely payments; the grace period extends coverage beyond the due date, allowing flexibility while maintaining protection.</data>
      <data key="d4">corroborates</data>
