      <data key="d3">The grace period allows continued coverage despite missed premium deadlines; since John Michael Anderson is the policy owner, he benefits from this provision when managing his monthly obligations.</data>
      <data key="d4">applies to owner</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.75</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="101a86f6-cba5-43af-ae57-a5d5f17d8c1d" target="7f8cb083-f7ed-4837-a460-150e15a7c2d1">
      <data key="d3">The grace period mechanism ensures continued coverage for John Michael Anderson even if he misses a premium deadline, reinforcing protection based on his role as the insured party.</data>
      <data key="d4">applies to insured</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.75</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="101a86f6-cba5-43af-ae57-a5d5f17d8c1d" target="b9bffd3e-9339-46c9-88e5-c86723b048a8">
      <data key="d3">The presence of a 31-day grace period depends on the policy having an established term—such as the 20-year term—which governs when payments are due and how long coverage may continue past missed deadlines.</data>
      <data key="d4">enables</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="101a86f6-cba5-43af-ae57-a5d5f17d8c1d" target="92e1786a-d888-499c-81ce-89af6f2f700d">
      <data key="d3">The 31-day grace period allows time to pay the $45 monthly premium without losing coverage, providing flexibility around the payment deadline.</data>
      <data key="d4">depends on</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.85</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="101a86f6-cba5-43af-ae57-a5d5f17d8c1d" target="c213cb6d-bc43-42c0-9cc8-b53860ab254b">
      <data key="d3">The existence of a grace period accommodates delays in automatic deductions, supporting the effectiveness of the monthly payment schedule.</data>
      <data key="d4">enables</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="101a86f6-cba5-43af-ae57-a5d5f17d8c1d" target="086e886c-9134-4e1e-85d7-0fcdb31e485b">
      <data key="d3">The existence of a 31-day grace period ensures ongoing protection of the policy, thereby preserving the potential payout to Sarah Elizabeth Anderson should she become the recipient of the death benefit.</data>
      <data key="d4">enables</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.75</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="101a86f6-cba5-43af-ae57-a5d5f17d8c1d" target="65530dff-13a5-4bc9-975b-c4c8ec2db1db">
      <data key="d3">Following the premium due date on the 15th, the grace period offers an extra 31 days of continued coverage, ensuring protection even if the payment arrives slightly late.</data>
      <data key="d4">follows</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="101a86f6-cba5-43af-ae57-a5d5f17d8c1d" target="8d7ba03c-5d26-4e8f-82f7-df2f969ad60b">
      <data key="d3">The grace period ensures continuous coverage beyond the due date, allowing time for the beneficiary to file the required claim form after the insured's passing without fear of policy lapse.</data>
      <data key="d4">depends on</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.85</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="101a86f6-cba5-43af-ae57-a5d5f17d8c1d" target="ecc65c44-a48a-4f2a-aa01-37fdd58978fd">
      <data key="d3">The 31-day grace period ensures continuous coverage beyond the premium due date, enabling time to prepare and submit necessary claim documents such as the certified death certificate when needed.</data>
      <data key="d4">enables claim</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="101a86f6-cba5-43af-ae57-a5d5f17d8c1d" target="00310326-ecb4-4736-a477-d83d6eec65e1">
      <data key="d3">Fact_sentence_1 elaborates on the grace period's role in maintaining coverage continuity, while fact_sentence_2 offers a general definition confirming its length and timing—both reinforce the same concept from slightly different angles.</data>
      <data key="d4">corroborates</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">1.0</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="101a86f6-cba5-43af-ae57-a5d5f17d8c1d" target="be5e26fa-04fc-4729-9543-1bbeb100990a">
      <data key="d3">Fact_sentence_1 explains what a grace period is; fact_sentence_2 affirms its practical effect—that coverage does not lapse during it—thus validating and clarifying the operational meaning of the grace period described earlier.</data>
      <data key="d4">corroborates</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="101a86f6-cba5-43af-ae57-a5d5f17d8c1d" target="637866d8-58b3-46e9-bfc7-f6fae898630c">
      <data key="d3">The grace period ensures continued coverage after the due date; if payment isn't made by its end, the policy lapses, making timely payment critical.</data>
      <data key="d4">depends on</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="101a86f6-cba5-43af-ae57-a5d5f17d8c1d" target="74f91656-5a40-43ff-9624-5be0747c6603">
      <data key="d3">The grace period ensures continued coverage beyond the due date; however, if the premium remains unpaid at the end of this period, the policy lapses, terminating protection entirely.</data>
      <data key="d4">depends on</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="101a86f6-cba5-43af-ae57-a5d5f17d8c1d" target="964764d9-dfdd-4820-9bcd-3378418cf555">
      <data key="d3">The grace period described in fact_sentence_1 depends on the fixed monthly due date established in fact_sentence_2, allowing temporary continuation of coverage after missed payments.</data>
      <data key="d4">depends on</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="101a86f6-cba5-43af-ae57-a5d5f17d8c1d" target="6fa1329d-8d5f-4720-bf13-810d2404088a">
      <data key="d3">Fact_sentence_1 specifies the 31-day grace period in the context of a particular policy, reinforcing the broader principle stated in fact_sentence_2 about allowable grace periods when premiums are late.</data>
      <data key="d4">corroborates</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="101a86f6-cba5-43af-ae57-a5d5f17d8c1d" target="929683b0-a1d7-47e6-974e-1af143ca05b4">
      <data key="d3">Fact_sentence_1 specifies the duration and purpose of the grace period; fact_sentence_2 affirms that coverage remains active during it, validating and reinforcing the operational implication described in fact_sentence_1.</data>
      <data key="d4">corroborates</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="101a86f6-cba5-43af-ae57-a5d5f17d8c1d" target="cd33eeaf-204c-4c25-b6c4-d8f541f0238a">
      <data key="d3">The 31-day grace period ensures continuous coverage past the premium due date, allowing the policy to remain active and eligible for death benefit payments under fact_sentence_2.</data>
      <data key="d4">depends on</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="101a86f6-cba5-43af-ae57-a5d5f17d8c1d" target="eb100753-e253-4af2-af0d-8207823389c7">
      <data key="d3">The grace period allows ongoing coverage beyond the due date, ensuring that death benefits remain accessible even if a premium is late, provided death occurs before the policy's end date.</data>
      <data key="d4">depends on</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="101a86f6-cba5-43af-ae57-a5d5f17d8c1d" target="6a2ec98a-aa86-4cd5-8e76-1036cf6ac3da">
      <data key="d3">The grace period ensures ongoing coverage beyond the premium due date, enabling the policyholder's death during this interval to trigger the standard lump-sum death benefit payout.</data>
      <data key="d4">enables payout</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="101a86f6-cba5-43af-ae57-a5d5f17d8c1d" target="717aac5d-150f-48ca-8d8c-4a8f6ad91954">
      <data key="d3">The 31-day grace period allows uninterrupted coverage post-premium due date, giving the policyholder sufficient time to exercise the option to convert to permanent insurance without needing new medical exams.</data>
      <data key="d4">enables conversion</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.92</data>
