    <edge source="101a86f6-cba5-43af-ae57-a5d5f17d8c1d" target="c42788ae-930f-4f31-8775-d205d38dc828">
      <data key="d3">The 31-day grace period ensures continuous coverage beyond the payment deadline, enabling the insured to maintain eligibility for converting the policy to permanent insurance before age 65 or policy end.</data>
      <data key="d4">enables conversion</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.87</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="101a86f6-cba5-43af-ae57-a5d5f17d8c1d" target="65760e57-7d92-40e5-bf11-d6031579bc4b">
      <data key="d3">The 31-day grace period ensures continuous coverage post-premium due date, enabling the insured to consider conversion to permanent insurance while maintaining protection. This temporal buffer directly facilitates the condition described in fact_sentence_2 regarding age-based pricing at conversion.</data>
      <data key="d4">enables conversion</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.87</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="101a86f6-cba5-43af-ae57-a5d5f17d8c1d" target="91b85462-1151-4d24-8a71-6adf0d18e83a">
      <data key="d3">The 31-day grace period ensures continued coverage post-premium due date, providing a window during which the policyholder may decide to convert the term policy into permanent insurance, triggering recalculation of premiums based on the selected coverage amount.</data>
      <data key="d4">enables conversion</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.85</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="101a86f6-cba5-43af-ae57-a5d5f17d8c1d" target="86082134-46ed-4548-a27f-2a5fed9c25ac">
      <data key="d3">The grace period ensures continued coverage post-due date, enabling time to consider converting to a permanent policy whose premium depends on classification—a key consideration when evaluating such transitions.</data>
      <data key="d4">complements</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.75</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="101a86f6-cba5-43af-ae57-a5d5f17d8c1d" target="4f67aca9-2ed1-4582-9192-9aa38dccf3e4">
      <data key="d3">The 31-day grace period ensures continuous coverage beyond the premium due date, allowing sufficient time for the beneficiary to file a claim after the insured’s passing, thereby supporting timely access to the required original policy document.</data>
      <data key="d4">depends on</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.85</data>
    </edge>
