      <data key="d3">Fact_sentence_2 specifies that non-payment beyond the 31-day grace period leads to policy lapse, making the 15th-of-the-month due date from fact_sentence_1 crucial for maintaining active coverage.</data>
      <data key="d4">conditional on</data>
