      <data key="d3">If the premium is not paid by the end of the grace period, coverage terminates, meaning no death benefit would be available. Therefore, the lump-sum disbursement described in fact_sentence_2 cannot occur under such circumstances.</data>
      <data key="d4">conditional dependence</data>
