      <data key="d3">Failure to maintain coverage through timely premium payment—as outlined in fact_sentence_2—directly prevents the fulfillment of the death benefit obligation detailed in fact_sentence_1, making the latter conditional on adherence to the former.</data>
      <data key="d4">conditional on</data>
