    </edge>
    <edge source="6a2ec98a-aa86-4cd5-8e76-1036cf6ac3da" target="6a8c51d1-93b9-4569-86fd-03b5a2ff4a43">
      <data key="d3">The death benefit payment method described in fact_sentence_1 may indirectly depend on prior decisions such as conversion, where the insured’s attained age plays a role in determining final policy terms and costs.</data>
      <data key="d4">depends on</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
