    </edge>
    <edge source="a00a97b2-e4e5-454c-aabc-bb7861c62db6" target="4e7f0ebe-b702-4139-8b00-7c2f414cdf49">
      <data key="d3">A suicide occurring within two years limits the insurer’s liability to refunding premiums, thereby restricting the fulfillment of the condition (proof of death) needed for a standard death benefit payout.</data>
      <data key="d4">conditions</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.85</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="a00a97b2-e4e5-454c-aabc-bb7861c62db6" target="eb100753-e253-4af2-af0d-8207823389c7">
      <data key="d3">A suicide within two years triggers a limitation where even if death occurs before policy expiry, the payout is capped at returned premiums, overriding standard death benefit rules.</data>
      <data key="d4">limits</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.85</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="a00a97b2-e4e5-454c-aabc-bb7861c62db6" target="6a2ec98a-aa86-4cd5-8e76-1036cf6ac3da">
      <data key="d3">A suicide occurring within the first two years limits the insurer’s liability to refunding premiums, thereby preventing the usual lump-sum death benefit payment outlined in the other statement.</data>
      <data key="d4">limits</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.85</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="a00a97b2-e4e5-454c-aabc-bb7861c62db6" target="964764d9-dfdd-4820-9bcd-3378418cf555">
      <data key="d3">The suicide exclusion limits payouts to refunded premiums only if suicide occurs within two years; this restriction relies on prior premium payments having been made, which are scheduled monthly per the first statement.</data>
      <data key="d4">conditional on</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.75</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="a00a97b2-e4e5-454c-aabc-bb7861c62db6" target="883362bb-b7cf-40c8-9801-eb185d0f0958">
      <data key="d3">The suicide exclusion within the first two years limits payouts to refunded premiums. No additional exclusions apply, confirming this clause stands alone as the sole exception to benefit payment.</data>
      <data key="d4">complements</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.85</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="05234738-a42a-43df-8af9-32fd04adea51" target="a00a97b2-e4e5-454c-aabc-bb7861c62db6">
      <data key="d2">entity_fact</data>
      <data key="d4">is subject to limitation by</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="06686aca-a168-46c7-8ad4-40a451d8e647" target="a00a97b2-e4e5-454c-aabc-bb7861c62db6">
      <data key="d2">entity_fact</data>
      <data key="d4">limits</data>
    </edge>
