      <data key="d3">The premium for the new policy depends on the extent of coverage being converted, and this amount interacts with the specific class of permanent policy selected, which further shapes the overall cost.</data>
      <data key="d4">modifies</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
