      <data key="d3">From chunk 2's perspective, chunk 1 serves as a concrete example illustrating key components discussed generally—such as beneficiary designations, premium payments, and policy validity—that exemplify real-world application of the rules outlined in the broader framework.</data>
      <data key="d4">contextual relation</data>
