    <edge source="8d7ba03c-5d26-4e8f-82f7-df2f969ad60b" target="ecc65c44-a48a-4f2a-aa01-37fdd58978fd">
      <data key="d3">Submitting a completed claim form is a prerequisite step that initiates the claims process, enabling the insurer to begin processing the request before additional documentation like a certified death certificate is reviewed.</data>
      <data key="d4">precedes</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.85</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="8d7ba03c-5d26-4e8f-82f7-df2f969ad60b" target="4f67aca9-2ed1-4582-9192-9aa38dccf3e4">
      <data key="d3">The requirement to submit a completed claim form supports the overall claims process, enabling the insurer to initiate review; this step directly enables the subsequent submission of supporting documents like the original policy.</data>
      <data key="d4">complements</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="8d7ba03c-5d26-4e8f-82f7-df2f969ad60b" target="1f53ae68-2eb4-4755-b66c-aa693a6029cb">
      <data key="d3">Submitting a completed claim form is necessary to initiate a death benefit claim, and such submissions must be directed to the specified postal address to ensure proper processing.</data>
      <data key="d4">directs to</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="8d7ba03c-5d26-4e8f-82f7-df2f969ad60b" target="e102366f-ab52-4878-8cf7-8763f33b2392">
      <data key="d3">The beneficiary must complete a claim form as part of the claims process; this form should be directed to the Claims Department of SecureLife Insurance Company.</data>
      <data key="d4">sent to</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="8d7ba03c-5d26-4e8f-82f7-df2f969ad60b" target="f60bbb6f-361a-478e-b45e-8d28c60a0370">
      <data key="d3">The submission of a completed claim form by the beneficiary triggers the start of the processing timeline, leading to the insurer’s commitment to issue payment within 30 days upon full documentation receipt.</data>
      <data key="d4">precedes</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="8d7ba03c-5d26-4e8f-82f7-df2f969ad60b" target="ef3425a0-1e50-49ab-b5a8-ef77f6ab44bc">
      <data key="d3">The completion of a claim form initiates the claims process, upon which the insurer evaluates any discrepancies such as misstated sex that may affect the final benefit amount.</data>
      <data key="d4">precedes</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.75</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="8d7ba03c-5d26-4e8f-82f7-df2f969ad60b" target="89eb9f0b-fb9d-4ed0-96df-faae58d5ebda">
      <data key="d3">Submitting a completed claim form is necessary for processing a death benefit payout, and the form's authenticity depends on being properly signed by an authorized official like the Chief Underwriting Officer.</data>
      <data key="d4">corroborates</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.65</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="8d7ba03c-5d26-4e8f-82f7-df2f969ad60b" target="93c2148f-1bce-4ce3-bc8c-ba54d157bd99">
      <data key="d3">The beneficiary must complete a claim form as part of the claims process, which must then be submitted to SecureLife Insurance Company.</data>
      <data key="d4">precedes</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="8d7ba03c-5d26-4e8f-82f7-df2f969ad60b" target="52ad74d3-5275-4b1c-9bcf-18120fb60997">
      <data key="d3">The submission of a claim form initiates the process during which the insurer evaluates potential adjustments to the death benefit if inaccuracies like misstated age are discovered.</data>
      <data key="d4">precedes</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.75</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="8d7ba03c-5d26-4e8f-82f7-df2f969ad60b" target="b9bffd3e-9339-46c9-88e5-c86723b048a8">
      <data key="d3">The need to submit a claim form is contingent on the existence of active coverage, such as the 20-year term described in the first fact, ensuring timely processing before expiration.</data>
      <data key="d4">conditional on</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.85</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="8d7ba03c-5d26-4e8f-82f7-df2f969ad60b" target="b178757c-5941-42c0-9651-c1536385e35b">
      <data key="d3">The requirement to submit a completed claim form applies to policies like the one issued on January 15, 2024, ensuring proper verification and processing under standard claims protocols.</data>
      <data key="d4">procedural relevance</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.85</data>
    </edge>
