      <data key="d3">Submitting a completed claim form, as stated in fact_sentence_2, is necessary to trigger the disbursement of the $500,000 death benefit mentioned in fact_sentence_1.</data>
      <data key="d4">required for</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
