      <data key="d3">The misstatement provision adjusts the death benefit according to the insured’s true age at the time of application, which only becomes relevant once the incontestability period has passed and the policy is legally protected from challenge.</data>
      <data key="d4">contextual support</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
